text Naranja_Desierto_G22_M00_Text_081B28F2 {
    "I’m the DAY-CARE LADY.\pWe can raise POKéMON for you.\pWould you like us to raise one?"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G22_M00_Text_081B2947 {
    "Which POKéMON should we raise for you?"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G22_M00_Text_081B296E {
    "Fine, we’ll raise your {STR_VAR_1} for\na while.\pCome back for it later."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G22_M00_Text_081B29AD {
    "We can raise two of your POKéMON.\nWould you like us to raise one more?"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G22_M00_Text_081B29F4 {
    "My husband was looking for you."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G22_M00_Text_081B2A14 {
    "Oh, fine, then.\nCome again."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G22_M00_Text_081B2A30 {
    "You don’t have enough money..."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G22_M00_Text_081B2A4F {
    "Will you take back the other one, too?"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G22_M00_Text_081B2A76 {
    "Fine.\nCome again."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G22_M00_Text_081B2A88 {
    "Ah, it’s you! Good to see you.\nYour POKéMON can only be doing good!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G22_M00_Text_081B2ACC {
    "By level, your {STR_VAR_1} has grown\nby {STR_VAR_2}."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G22_M00_Text_081B2AEF {
    "Your POKéMON team is full.\nMake room, then come see me."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G22_M00_Text_081B2B49 {
    "If you want your {STR_VAR_1} back,\nit will cost ¥{STR_VAR_2}."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G22_M00_Text_081B2B75 {
    "Perfect!\nHere’s your POKéMON."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G22_M00_Text_081B2B93 {
    "{PLAYER} took back {STR_VAR_1} from\nthe DAY-CARE LADY."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G22_M00_Text_081B2BBB {
    "Oh? But you have just one POKéMON.\pCome back another time."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G22_M00_Text_081B2BF6 {
    "Will you take your POKéMON back?"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G22_M00_Text_081B2C17 {
    "If you leave me that POKéMON,\nwhat will you battle with?\pCome back another time."
}
